From: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
Date: Mon, 24 Nov 2025 14:36:46 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi-scripts: allow VLAN configuration for open auth mode

Without vlan_possible=1, VLAN settings are ignored for open networks.
Set it for the open/owe auth type in iface_auth_type() in
usr/share/ucode/wifi/ap.uc.

Fixes: OWRT-9051

Signed-off-by: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
---
--- a/src/usr/share/ucode/wifi/ap.uc
+++ b/src/usr/share/ucode/wifi/ap.uc
@@ -133,6 +133,8 @@ function iface_auth_type(config, band) {
 	switch(config.auth_type) {
 	case 'none':
 	case 'owe':
+		/* allow VLAN configuration for open auth mode (OWRT-9051) */
+		config.vlan_possible = 1;
 		config.wps_possible = 1;
 		config.wps_state = 1;
 
